sover popularity. After releasing his album Mama Said Knock You Out in 1990, he starred in two movies and appeared and performed at the MTV Inaugural Ball in honor of President Clinton. Throughout the mid-90s, LL continued to branch out into acting, taking roles in films such as Woo, Halloween: H20, and the Oliver Stone football opus Any Given Sunday. During this time, he released All World: Greatest Hits (1996) and Phenomenon (1997), an album that did not do well commercially or critically. LL confirmed his attraction to acting over the next few years, taking a small part in 2000’s Charlie’s Angels and then scoring a starring role in the 2002 remake of Rollerball.","provider":"discogs","ref":"discogs:artist:35746","relations":{"aliases":[{"id":206948,"name":"James Todd Smith"}],"groups":null,"members":null,"namevariations":["Cool J","Double L","II Cool","J. Smith","J.J. Cool","L .L .Cool J","L L Cool J","L L Cool J.","L. L. Cool J","L. L. Cool J.","L. L. Kool J","L.L Cool J","L.L Cool J.","L.L.","L.L. COOL J","L.L. Cool","L.L. Cool J","L.L. Cool J.","L.L. Cool j","L.L. Cool. J.","L.L. Cool.J","L.L. CoolJ","L.L.Codl J.","L.L.Coll J.","L.L.Cool","L.L.Cool J","L.L.Cool J.","L.LCool J","LL","LL Cole J","LL Cool","LL Cool 'J'","LL Cool D!","LL Cool J.","LL Cool Jay","LL Cools","LL Kool","LL 酷 J","LL. Cool J","LL. Cool J.","LL.Cool J","LLCool J","LLCool Jay","LLCoolJ","LLcool J","LL酷J","Ll Cool J","Ll Cool J.","l.l cool j","Ｌ．Ｌ．クールＪ"]},"schemaVersion":2,"sourceUrl":"https://www.discogs.com/artist/35746-LL-Cool-J","type":"artist","urls":["http://llcoolj.com","https://www.instagram.com/llcoolj","https://www.youtube.com/user/llcooljofficial","https://www.tiktok.com/@llcoolj","https://www.facebook.com/LLCOOLJ","https://twitter.com/llcoolj","https://myspace.com/llcoolj","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/LL_Cool_J","https://www.imdb.com/name/nm0005112"]}},"/api/discogs/artist/4122267/profile":{"cached":true,"profile":{"id":"4122267","image":"https://i.discogs.com/sz_SfvYpvWHlvCrk